---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact" description="Contact Chen Gadi through the website. Course questions, private student requests, and general inquiries, with replies in the Student Hub.">
  <section class="border-b border-slate-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-16 pb-12 md:pt-20 md:pb-16">
      <p class="academic-kicker">LET’S KEEP THE CONVERSATION HERE</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-6xl text-slate-900 mb-6">Get in touch.</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Questions about a course, logistics, personal requests, and other inquiries are handled through this website. Open a conversation, save your recovery code, and return here for my reply.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mt-4 leading-relaxed" dir="rtl" lang="he">לשאלות על הקורס, לוגיסטיקה ופניות אישיות, פותחים שיחה כאן באתר. התשובה תופיע במערכת. אין צורך לשלוח מייל.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-14">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <section class="contact-route">
        <span class="academic-kicker">FOR MY STUDENTS</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl mt-4 mb-4">A question for the class?</h2>
        <p>Ask anonymously, browse existing discussions, and help classmates with anonymous replies. Use the class code shared in your lecture or tutorial.</p>
        <a href="/students" class="academic-primary mt-6">Anonymous course Q&amp;A ↗</a>
      </section>
      <section class="contact-route">
        <span class="academic-kicker">JUST BETWEEN US</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl mt-4 mb-4">A private conversation.</h2>
        <p>For course logistics or personal matters, choose your class and open a private request. For research, collaboration, or general inquiries, no class code is needed.</p>
        <a href="/students?course=general" class="academic-primary mt-6">Open a private conversation ↗</a>
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="research-focus mt-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mb-3">How to find your reply</h2>
      <p>Your private conversations stay under “My private requests.” Access is saved in this browser. Keep your private recovery code to return from another device. It is the key to your conversations, so keep it to yourself.</p>
      <a href="/students" class="academic-secondary">Return to the Student Hub ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
